 "兩圖是 200／500／1000 公尺相同窗格、4 公尺比對格距的 DEM 顯示重採樣，共用一對相對高程灰階範圍。陰影的垂直起伏放大 8 倍；影像不能顯示礦物或基地安全。": "Both images are DEM display resamplings of the same 200/500/1000 m window at a 4 m comparison spacing, sharing one pair of relative-elevation grayscale limits. Hillshade vertical relief is exaggerated 8×; the images cannot show minerals or base safety.",
 "兩圖是相同公尺窗格、共用灰階高程範圍的原生 DEM 顯示重採樣。陰影的垂直起伏放大 8 倍；原始月地 5 m／火地 20 m 比對格距不因顯示重採樣而改變。影像不能顯示礦物或基地安全。": "Both images are display resamplings of the native DEMs over the same meter window, sharing a grayscale elevation range. Vertical relief in the hillshade is exaggerated 8×; the original comparison grid spacing of 5 m for Moon–Earth and 20 m for Mars–Earth is not changed by the display resampling. The images cannot show minerals or base safety.",
