 "八個月球場址、三種尺度，共 24 個查詢。每個查詢從同一批地球窗格選出三種地形檢索方法及兩種對照，亂序後共 120 對。先只評地貌形狀，再看來源資料評材質與基地情境；資料不足時選「無法判定」。場址類型、方法與排名均不在此頁揭露。": "Eight lunar sites at three scales: 24 queries in total. For each query, candidates from three terrain-retrieval methods and two controls are drawn from the same set of Earth windows; shuffled, this gives 120 pairs in total. Rate landform shape only first, then view the source data to rate material and base context; when data are insufficient, choose \"Cannot determine\". Site types, methods and rankings are not revealed on this page.",
 "六個月球、兩個火星局部 DTM 場址，各以 200／500／1000 公尺查詢，共 24 個問題與 120 對窗格。每題取兩種方法的候選與隨機對照，方法、排名與場址名稱均隱藏。先評形狀，再看來源證據；材質與任務資料不足時請選「無法判定」。此資料包固定於擴庫前 Meteor Crater 與 Kilbourne Hole 兩處地球候選，是有限候選池的方法比較，尚不能證明發現新地球類比地點。": "Six lunar and two Martian local DTM sites, each queried at 200 / 500 / 1000 m: 24 questions and 120 window pairs in total. Each question takes candidates from two methods plus random controls; methods, rankings and site names are all hidden. Rate shape first, then look at the source evidence; when material or mission data are insufficient, choose \"Cannot determine\". This data package is fixed to the two pre-expansion Earth candidates, Meteor Crater and Kilbourne Hole; it is a method comparison over a limited candidate pool and cannot yet prove the discovery of new Earth analog sites.",
 "六個月球、兩個火星局部 DTM 場址，各以 200／500／1000 公尺查詢，共 24 題、120 對。候選來自目前八處地球研究區的 2014 地貌基線、自訓小模型及按場址抽樣的對照。先只評地形；評完形狀才看可用的地球地表圖和土地覆蓋。方法、排名及地球場址名稱另存，評分頁不揭露。這是開發場址的有限候選池評估，不是全新地理保留集。": "Six lunar and two Martian local DTM sites, each queried at 200 / 500 / 1000 m: 24 questions and 120 pairs in total. Candidates come from the 2014 landform baseline over the current eight Earth study areas, the self-trained small model, and per-site sampled controls. Rate terrain only first; only after rating shape, view the available Earth surface maps and land cover. Methods, rankings and Earth site names are stored separately and are not revealed on the rating page. This is a limited-candidate-pool evaluation on development sites, not a brand-new geographic holdout set.",
 "六個月球與兩個火星局部 DTM 場址、三種小尺度，共 24 題／120 對。地球候選只來自未參與模型開發的 Lava Beds 與 Pilot Valley 兩處固定地理保留區，傳統地貌簽章、小模型和抽樣對照亂序展示。方法、地球場址及排名隱藏；先評地形，再記錄材質與任務是否有足夠證據。此包沒有逐窗格材質或安全真值，資料不足請選「無法判定」。月／火查詢仍是既有開發場址，請勿把結果視為全球類比準確率。": "Six lunar and two Martian local DTM sites at three small scales: 24 questions / 120 pairs in total. Earth candidates come only from two fixed geographic holdout areas, Lava Beds and Pilot Valley, which were not used in model development; traditional landform signatures, the small model and sampled controls are shown in shuffled order. Methods, Earth sites and rankings are hidden; rate the terrain first, then record whether there is sufficient evidence for material and mission context. This package has no per-window material or safety ground truth; if data are insufficient, choose \"Cannot determine\". The Moon/Mars queries are still existing development sites; do not treat the results as global analog accuracy.",
